	(text "HUB: ADAU1467 (clock master, routing, CM5 I/O)\nOne 12.288 MHz XO into XTALIN/MCLK; hub drives CODEC_MCLK (CLKOUT) and every BCLK/LRCLK.\nSelf-boot from U5 W25Q32 on the SPI master (SPI mode 3, read 0x03). I2C slave, ADDR1/ADDR0 = 0.\nPLL filter per DS Fig. 16 (150 pF || 5.6 nF + 4.3 k, to PVDD). VDRIVE to GND via R26: DVDD is external.\nOUT0/IN0 = CM5, OUT2/IN2 = codec, OUT3/IN3 + SDATAIO4/5 = A2B, SDATAIO0-3 = spare CM5 lanes.\nThe coefficient channel must be routed bit-exact: no ASRC, gain, mix or dither."
		(at 365.76 93.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
		)
		(uuid "21028f1a-8d75-4e5c-a241-6f1988f4e47c")
	)
	(text "CODEC: ADAU1372\nADC0 = cabin mic U7 IM68A130A, single-ended analogue (John, 2026-10-21), from 3V3A via R6/C35.\nADC1 = comms tap off the T2 secondary: R7/R8 10k/10k, C27, BAT54S D1 clamp (ADC FS 0.90 Vrms).\nDAC0 (HPOUTL +/-, 1.94 Vrms diff FS) drives T4 SM-LP-5001 primary directly (ruling 10).\nT4 secondary (aircraft side) -> R10 10k -> C37 220 nF film -> PV_OUT -> K1 Form A; return PV_RTN -> K1 mic-lo.\nAbout 69 mVrms into a ~470 ohm mic input at 0 dBFS [derived; panel input spec unknown]. No path to our GND."
		(at 609.6 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
		)
		(uuid "926fcc35-ad30-47f4-b07d-7f231289ec6e")
	)
	(text "AIRCRAFT / BYPASS: aircraft-powered whenever we are off\nT2/T3 Triad SP-74: primaries in parallel on the panel earphone line, secondaries paralleled (3/5, 4/6).\nK1 = U10 (mic-hi) + U11 (mic-lo), AQW612S each (ruling 2). LEDs OFF = bypass: electret J6 -> panel mic.\nCTL_MIC high -> Q2 on -> LEDs on (VBAT via R23/R24 390R, 5.1-12.8 mA) -> Form A: PV_OUT / PV_RTN (T4) -> panel.\nBoth mic legs stay isolated from our GND in both states. Watchdog parked (ruling 4). SP-74 polarity unverified."
		(at 132.08 370.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
		)
		(uuid "29c75c34-0791-4260-8489-8ccef92b6520")
	)
	(text "POWER + HOST HEADER\nVBAT = AeroNode BAT_PWR: 2S LiFePO4, 5.0-7.3 V [repo, not confirmed on the AeroNode sheet].\nU1 3V3 buck (I/O) / U2 1V2 buck (hub core 330 mA typ, 940 mA max; TPS62160 is 1 A) / U3 3V3A LDO.\nU2 PG = RESET_N for hub + codec. J1/J2 mirror AeroNode J3/J4 pin-for-pin (2026-08-31 sheet).\nCM5 = I2S consumer (rp1_i2s1), max 8 ch, 32-bit. HOST_SDO1 = coefficient lane (ruling 8).\nCTL_MIC drives K1. CTL_SPKR -> AD2428 IO7 -> GPIO-over-distance -> cup K2 (ruling 11). A2B IRQ unused: CM5 polls."
		(at 95.25 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
		)
		(uuid "e14e04e5-b96e-4c41-8e8e-44e47aeb38a7")
	)
	(text "A2B MAIN NODE: AD2428 (ruling 9), circuit per EVAL-AD2428WD1BZ sheet 2, B side\nVBUS8 = U12 LM2731X boost from VBAT, 8.00 V (R27/R28, Cf C60) - ruling 12, docs/a2b-bus-power-budget.md.\nVIN = VBUS8 via D2 (7.6 V, max 9.0). Bus power: VBUS8 -> D3 -> R18 -> Q1 (gate: SWP via R19) -> L3 -> line +.\nLine - -> L4 -> VSSN (internal switch, 300 mA; cups need ~188 mA worst). SENSE via R20. A2B_SWCTL.MODE = 0.\nCoupling: FB1/FB2 to BCM, C49, L5/L6, C50, FL1 CMC, R21/R22 + C51, C52/C53 series, C54-C56. J3 -> cup L -> cup R."
		(at 637.54 320.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
		)
		(uuid "f3a52065-fff9-418c-ab72-8d31f69d7d64")
	)
